AKEDORE kernel 4.19 for POCO F1 (beryllium)
===========================================

  Custom Linux 4.19.325 kernel for the Xiaomi POCO F1 (SDM845), for
  ROMs with a 4.19 vendor. Based on Aozora 4.19 by Kaiyaa77.

  Formerly "fsociety kernel" (TEST1.x - TEST2.3). Renamed to AKEDORE
  in v1; the code of v1 is TEST2.3.

Contents
--------

